    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into <i>Elicion</i> \u2014 a hand-crafted action-adventure RPG brimming with danger, mystery, and untold secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ancient <strong>Crystals of Power</strong> resurface after centuries of silence, the balance of magic begins to unravel. Darkness spreads across the land, and four unlikely heroes \u2014 <strong>Hiro, Sasha, Ruby</strong>, and <strong>Malus</strong> \u2014 must rise to restore order before it's too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay &amp; Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat</strong> with fluid melee and elemental magic. Each hero has a unique fighting style and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast, handcrafted world</strong> \u2014 from ancient ruins and enchanted forests to mountain fortresses and lost cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 unique collectibles</strong> scattered across the world, waiting to be discovered by curious players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles</strong> and hidden paths that reward exploration and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging boss battles</strong> that demand strategy, timing, and clever use of each hero's powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich quests</strong> with meaningful dialogue and character development. While your choices don\u2019t alter the ending, they deepen the world and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-based rewards</strong> that offer new paths, lore, and helpful tools for your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25\u201330 hours of gameplay</strong> in the main questline, with even more to discover through side quests and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive fantasy soundtrack</strong> designed to enhance every moment of your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller and keyboard/mouse support</strong>, with customizable input options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lost history of Elicion, face the shadows of its past, and forge your legacy in this <strong>single-player, story-driven fantasy adventure</strong>. The fate of the realm lies in your hands \u2014 will you answer the call?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into <i>Elicion</i> \u2014 a hand-crafted action-adventure RPG brimming with danger, mystery, and untold secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ancient <strong>Crystals of Power</strong> resurface after centuries of silence, the balance of magic begins to unravel. Darkness spreads across the land, and four unlikely heroes \u2014 <strong>Hiro, Sasha, Ruby</strong>, and <strong>Malus</strong> \u2014 must rise to restore order before it's too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay &amp; Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat</strong> with fluid melee and elemental magic. Each hero has a unique fighting style and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast, handcrafted world</strong> \u2014 from ancient ruins and enchanted forests to mountain fortresses and lost cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 unique collectibles</strong> scattered across the world, waiting to be discovered by curious players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles</strong> and hidden paths that reward exploration and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging boss battles</strong> that demand strategy, timing, and clever use of each hero's powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich quests</strong> with meaningful dialogue and character development. While your choices don\u2019t alter the ending, they deepen the world and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-based rewards</strong> that offer new paths, lore, and helpful tools for your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25\u201330 hours of gameplay</strong> in the main questline, with even more to discover through side quests and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive fantasy soundtrack</strong> designed to enhance every moment of your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller and keyboard/mouse support</strong>, with customizable input options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lost history of Elicion, face the shadows of its past, and forge your legacy in this <strong>single-player, story-driven fantasy adventure</strong>. The fate of the realm lies in your hands \u2014 will you answer the call?</p>",
